subagent off_topic:
    label: "Off Topic"
    description: "Redirect conversation to relevant subagents when user request goes off-topic"

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | The user request is off-topic. Do not answer general knowledge questions.
              Redirect the conversation by explaining that you can help with:
              - Downstream fuel distribution (pricing, logistics, dealers)
              - Upstream E&P operations (offshore, compliance, workforce)
              - Midstream (pipelines, terminals, trading)
              - Agentforce capabilities for Oil & Gas
              - Brazilian market context and opportunity sizing
              Ask how you can help with these topics.
